ck a control activation each time a touch activates a UIKit control, without a call on each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control."}]},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/ChoosingDestinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","title":"Choosing Destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/ChoosingDestinations","abstract":[{"text":"Deliver events to your logs, your traces, a server or memory, and decide what each destination may see.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/SessionsAndStandardContext":{"url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/sessionsandstandardcontext","role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Sessions and Standard Context","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/SessionsAndStandardContext","abstract":[{"text":"Stamp every event with its session and with the app, device, system, locale and network it was tracked on.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/IdentifyingPeople":{"role":"article","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Traffluent knows people only by a pseudonymous session. An identifier that outlives one is yours to add, store, reset and gate with consent."}],"url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/identifyingpeople","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/IdentifyingPeople","type":"topic","title":"Identifying People"},"doc://StandardContext/documentation/StandardContext":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"StandardContext","url":"\/documentation\/standardcontext","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stamp every event with the app, device, operating system, locale and network connection it was tracked on."}]},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/PersistingRecords":{"abstract":[{"text":"Keep each record on di